---
![отжимания от мяча](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b657e798-8ee7-4353-8faf-40d9474bad7c)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Place both hands on the sides of the ball, positioning it directly under your chest. Extend your arms to support your body in a high plank, balancing on your toes. This is your starting position.

### Step 2
Engage your core and slowly lower your upper body down until your chest lightly touches the ball.

### Step 3
Squeeze your chest muscles and push through your hands to press yourself back up to the starting position.


{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Keep your body in a straight line without letting your hips sag or arch. Look slightly forward and work through a full range of motion.

• Keep your core and abs tight throughout the entire movement for stability.

• This exercise places extra stress on your wrists, so make sure to warm them up thoroughly beforehand.
{{< /callout >}}
